{"duration_api_ms":669897,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"17c8abc0-b1bd-490f-ad18-bf30d45cdf7b","total_cost_usd":2.8388909,"usage":{"input_tokens":52,"cache_creation_input_tokens":125645,"cache_read_input_tokens":2360827,"output_tokens":68060,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":46772},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":125645,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":150530,"cache_creation_input_tokens":817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":817},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1450,"outputTokens":25,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0001575,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":52,"outputTokens":68060,"cacheReadInputTokens":2360827,"cacheCreationInputTokens":125645,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.8387334,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":46772,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":125645,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":31,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I've written `work/weights.npz`, `NOTES.md` and `predictions.json`. The repair is set by construction (no fitting) and changes 256 of the 7,428 parameters (limit 371), so it hasn't been tested in a simulation.\n\n**What I changed and why:** the recorded data showed the faulty network gets stuck once demand ends. Cars left in the W2 pocket are invisible, so the network holds phase 2 forever and never serves phase 3. Two of the six recorded episodes ran to the 90-minute cap this way. I now feed the network an estimate of each dead input instead of 0:\n\n`W2_hat = E2 + 0.5·t_green − 0.1·phase3` (same form for the halting count and the vehicle count)\n\n- **E2:** the east left-turn pocket. Phase 3 serves both left pockets and they have the same demand.\n- **0.5·t_green:** W2 has been red at least as long as the current green. This term breaks the deadlock.\n- **−0.1·phase3:** cancels the time term at the first decision point of phase 3, so it can't hold phase 3 green.\n\nThe estimate is built into four W1 columns (q_E2, d_E2, phase3, t_green).\n\n**Checks (forward passes only):**\n- The edited network matches the original fed with the estimate to within 3e-15.\n- In the stuck end states the faulty network picks phase 2 at 678 of 678 decisions; the repaired one picks phase 3 at 998 of 1,019.\n- An empty junction now cycles 2 → 3 → 2, serving W2 about once a minute.\n- Against full-information decisions on the N/S pair (S2 hidden and estimated the same way), the time term costs about 2% of normal decisions. I accepted that to break the deadlock.\n\n**Predicted test TTS (veh-h):** low 35.1, nominal 45.7, high 57.0.","ttft_ms":1141,"type":"result","duration_ms":684536,"uuid":"5fd5693d-e0ab-43ce-b7e6-29901ef1ce88","ttft_stream_ms":1001,"time_to_request_ms":42,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":2,"system_prompt":5,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":1,"input_attachments":7,"input_hooks":2,"